<div class="top"><span class="logo"><i>S</i>MathSonify.com</span><div class="tog" id="theme"><button data-t="light">Light</button><button data-t="dark" class="on">Dark</button></div></div>
<main>
 <span class="pill" id="pill"><i class="dot"></i><span id="pillT" data-i18n="offline.pill">offline</span></span>
 <h1 id="h1" data-i18n-html="offline.title">The signal <em>dropped.</em></h1>
 <p class="sub" id="sub" data-i18n="offline.subOffline"></p>
 <div class="stage" id="stage"><canvas id="cv" aria-label="A wave on the left, your device, that cannot reach a dotted line on the right, the internet, because the line is broken in the middle"></canvas><div class="mid" data-i18n="offline.noRoute" id="mid">no route</div><span class="cap l" data-i18n="offline.deviceCap">your device · f(x) = sin(x)</span><span class="cap r" id="capR" data-i18n="offline.internetCap">the internet</span></div>
 <div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" id="retry"><span id="retryT" data-i18n="offline.retry">Try again</span></button><a class="btn" id="open" href="/studio" data-i18n="offline.openStudio">Open the Studio →</a><button class="btn ghost" data-i18n="offline.hear" id="hear">♪ Hear the signal</button></div>
 <div class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
 <section class="works" id="works"><div class="card yes"><h3 data-i18n="offline.worksTitle">Still works, offline</h3><ul><li data-i18n="offline.works1">Studio — type, graph, play</li><li data-i18n="offline.works2">Guess — practice rounds</li><li data-i18n="offline.works3">Exports you already made</li></ul></div><div class="card no"><h3 data-i18n="offline.needsTitle">Needs the internet</h3><ul><li data-i18n="offline.needs1">Opening shared links</li><li data-i18n="offline.needs2">Notify-me sign-ups</li><li data-i18n="offline.needs3">Support and payments</li></ul></div></section>
</main>
<footer data-i18n="offline.footer">MathSonify.com · your equations are drawn on your device</footer>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
